{"product_id":"tales-of-passion-tales-of-woe","title":"Tales of Passion, Tales of Woe","description":"\u003cp\u003eSet in Paris at the end of the eighteenth century, Josephine begins to awaken to the reality of her recent marriage to 'the Corsican' Napoleon Bonaparte, now General-in-Chief of the Army of Italy. Through Josephine's diary entries and Napoleon's impassioned - almost disturbing - love letters, an astonishing portrait of an ingenuous, compassionate woman emerges, set against one of the most tumultuous periods in European history. Written in a spare but compelling style, this beautifully crafted novel brings the amazing drama of the legendary Josephine to vibrant life.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 130 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Sandra Gulland\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780747261919\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 416\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45717793407129,"sku":"15RC-5-9780747261919","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68c3ed6625cba_Tales_of_Passion__Tales_of_Woe_Sandra_Gulland.jpg?v=1757760591","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/tales-of-passion-tales-of-woe","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}